 "remarks": "Welcome to 15 Robert Court, a spacious and versatile two-family home offering an exceptional opportunity for homeowners, extended families, and investors alike. The property features two well-proportioned apartments, each offering 3 bedrooms and 11/2 bathrooms, providing generous living space and excellent flexibility.  A major advantage of this property is the new central gas heating and air-conditioning system serving all three levels of the home, providing year-round comfort and efficiency. The home also features a roof less than 10 years old, offering additional peace of mind for the new owner.The lower level provides plenty of storage space, adding valuable functionality and flexibility that is often difficult to find in a two-family property. The generous storage area can accommodate household belongings, seasonal items, equipment, and more.The two-apartment configuration creates an ideal opportunity to live in one unit while generating rental income from the other, accommodate extended family members, or utilize the property as an income-producing investment. With two 3-bedroom units, the property is particularly attractive to renters seeking larger living accommodations. This property benefits from the city's strong rental market, convenient transportation, shopping, restaurants, employment centers, parks, and easy access to major commuter routes. A great opportunity to own a substantial two-family property in Stamford with the flexibility to live, rent, or invest.",
